  "sourceTitle": "Crock Pot Deer Meat",
  "sourceText": "Crock Pot Deer Meat\nBy: Kitch-N-Chik\nPublished: Wednesday, December 23, 2009 - 11:43pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 lbs. deer meat\n1 can cream of mushroom soup\n1 can celery soup\n1 med. onion\n1 can water\n1 cup flour\n1 cup cooking oil\n teaspoon pepper\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n teaspoon lemon pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Salt, pepper and lemon pepper and flour meat. Brown on both sides and place in crock pot. Add remaining ingredients and cook for 4 to 6 hours on medium. Serve over rice.",
